{"suttaId":"tha-ap508","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[3090,3107],"vripara":"68"},"segments":{"tha-ap508:0.3":"Mātuluṅgaphaladāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap508:1.1":"“Kaṇikāraṃva jalitaṃ, puṇṇamāyeva candimaṃ;","tha-ap508:1.3":"Jalantaṃ dīparukkhaṃva, addasaṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","tha-ap508:2.1":"“Mātuluṅgaphalaṃ gayha, adāsiṃ satthuno ahaṃ;","tha-ap508:2.3":"Dakkhiṇeyyassa vīrassa [dhīrassa (sī.)], pasanno sehi pāṇibhi.","tha-ap508:3.1":"“Ekatiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ phalaṃ adadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap508:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap508:4.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap508:5.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap508:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap508:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā mātuluṅgaphaladāyako thero imā Gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap508:8.1":"Mātuluṅgaphaladāyakattherassāpadānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
